# HF Space First

- For execution requests in this repo (train/eval/pipeline), assume the target is the Hugging Face Space unless the user explicitly says local.
- Before running commands, confirm the execution surface in one sentence (HF Space vs local).
- Do not run local substitutes when the user asked for Space execution.
- If remote execution cannot be performed directly, stop and provide exact Space steps/log checks instead of silently running local.
- When troubleshooting Space crashes, prioritize `app.py` startup/runtime fixes and Space logs over local environment debugging.
